      "Description of Tetouan... Built in the style of a kasbah, the city of Tetouan, formerly known as Titawin, represents a perfect blend of Arab-Spanish culture. In its winding streets, you will embrace the Spanish rhythms the city has known, enjoy the sea breeze mingling with birdsong, and be captivated by its charming treasures. The calls of vendors inviting customers to buy their wares fill the air. The old medina also houses an ethnographic museum and an archaeological museum, preserving the city's most precious treasures.",
